      "writtenOn": "2026-07-01T08:10:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it enough to keep this module under \"service_path\"?\n\nIsn\u0027t it better to define as a top-level yang?",
      "revId": "8972941f48ef63f5ce12cc09ca1124e200b670ce",
